### 2. Python Backend Files

#### [MODIFY] `main.py`
- Add CORS middleware (to allow frontend at `localhost:5173`)
- Register hospital router under prefix `/api/v1`

#### [NEW] `app/models/hospital.py`
- SQLAlchemy ORM model for `Hospital` table

#### [NEW] `app/schemas/hospital.py`
- `HospitalBase` — shared fields
- `HospitalCreate` — for POST requests
- `HospitalUpdate` — for PUT requests
- `HospitalResponse` — for API responses (includes `HospitalId`)

#### [NEW] `app/routers/hospital.py`
- FastAPI router with 5 endpoints:

| Method | Path | Stored Procedure | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/hospitals` | `SpGetHospitals` | List all (optional `?search=`) |
| GET | `/hospitals/{id}` | `SpGetHospitalById` | Get by ID |
| POST | `/hospitals` | `SpInsertHospital` | Create new |
| PUT | `/hospitals/{id}` | `SpUpdateHospital` | Update |
| DELETE | `/hospitals/{id}` | `SpDeleteHospital` | Soft delete |

All endpoints call stored procedures via raw SQL (`CALL SpName(...)`), no ORM queries.

