### 3. Frontend Integration

#### [MODIFY] `HospitalMaster.tsx`
- Remove `generateInitialData()` mock data function
- Add `useEffect` to fetch hospitals from `GET /api/v1/hospitals` on mount
- Replace `setRecords(...)` local state mutations with API calls:
  - Save → `POST /api/v1/hospitals`
  - Update → `PUT /api/v1/hospitals/{id}`
  - Delete → `DELETE /api/v1/hospitals/{id}`
- Add loading states and error handling (toast or inline message)
- Search remains client-side filtering on fetched data (no change to UI)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The frontend API base URL will be read from `.env` as `VITE_API_URL`. The existing `frontend/.env` already has `VITE_FRONTEND_URL`. A new variable `VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1` will be added.

> [!NOTE]
> **No UI/layout changes** are made to the frontend. Only data-fetching logic is replaced.

